    "title": "Flagstaff Celebrates with Starlight in the Square - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff ,\n7 hours ago Flagstaff, Arizona, the world’s first International Dark Sky City, is celebrating 25 years of its historic designation with the second annual Starlight in the Square, presented in partnership with the Flagstaff Dark Skies Coalition and the Downtown Flagstaff Foundation. This unique downtown event takes place on Saturday, April 18th, from 5:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m., offering an immersive celestial experience unlike any other city can create. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
